WEBVTT

00:04.420 --> 00:10.050
ずっと信じている

00:04.420 --> 00:10.050
zutto shinjite iru

00:04.420 --> 00:10.050
I have always believed

00:10.180 --> 00:14.560
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.180 --> 00:14.560
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

00:10.180 --> 00:14.560
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.560 --> 00:17.850
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.570 --> 00:31.490
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.570 --> 00:31.490
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.570 --> 00:31.490
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.490 --> 00:34.200
空回りするけど

00:31.490 --> 00:34.200
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.490 --> 00:34.200
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.660 --> 00:37.870
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.660 --> 00:37.870
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.660 --> 00:37.870
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:38.000 --> 00:41.590
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:38.000 --> 00:41.590
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:38.000 --> 00:41.590
You should be yourself.

00:41.710 --> 00:47.430
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.710 --> 00:47.430
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.710 --> 00:47.430
But you know... a messed up scenario

00:49.090 --> 00:54.600
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.090 --> 00:54.600
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.090 --> 00:54.600
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.600 --> 00:56.100
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.140 --> 01:01.560
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.140 --> 01:01.560
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.140 --> 01:01.560
The wind... it caresses my cheek.

01:01.820 --> 01:05.240
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.820 --> 01:05.240
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.820 --> 01:05.240
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.240 --> 01:10.120
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.240 --> 01:10.120
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.240 --> 01:10.120
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.240 --> 01:15.750
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.240 --> 01:15.750
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.240 --> 01:15.750
these feelings won't ever change.

01:16.000 --> 01:20.330
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:16.000 --> 01:20.330
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:16.000 --> 01:20.330
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.330 --> 01:23.960
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:39.350 --> 01:40.810
Onee-chan, what's wrong?

01:41.070 --> 01:41.730
Are you sick?

01:42.140 --> 01:44.470
That's sexy, Izumi-san!

01:44.730 --> 01:47.320
Is that all you two can say?

01:47.460 --> 01:49.580
What, aren't you done yet?

01:50.480 --> 01:51.550
Yoshitaka!

01:51.630 --> 01:54.320
Haven't you been working me hard recently?

01:54.450 --> 01:57.830
Now, now. There's no way I would do something as underhanded as that.

01:58.430 --> 02:01.530
I'm doing it to help you pay back your debt as soon as possible.

02:03.370 --> 02:05.120
All right, now to divide up the chores!

02:05.270 --> 02:06.330
Mitsuki-chan, make some coffee.

02:06.410 --> 02:07.950
Anna-chan, you straighten up the books that are scattered around.

02:08.140 --> 02:10.180
Izumi, you clean the bathroom, clean the pool, clean the attic,

02:10.260 --> 02:11.260
move the bureaus on the first floor to the second floor,

02:11.280 --> 02:12.160
the bureaus on the second floor to the third floor,

02:12.270 --> 02:13.780
and the bureaus on the third floor to the first floor.

02:13.870 --> 02:14.580
What the hell?!

02:37.360 --> 02:38.650
Good work, Onee-chan.

02:38.830 --> 02:39.780
Do you want to take a shower?

02:39.880 --> 02:42.310
I'll rinse your back!

02:45.700 --> 02:47.980
Summer's almost over, huh?

02:51.330 --> 02:54.220
How long am I going to keep living like this?

02:54.650 --> 02:57.350
Do you not like doing maid work, Onee-chan?

02:57.630 --> 02:59.380
The work isn't really the problem.

02:59.660 --> 03:03.380
But always being forced to go head-to-head with Yoshitaka in his house sucks!

03:03.710 --> 03:04.680
At this rate...

03:05.820 --> 03:08.480
Izumi-san's skin is so smooth!

03:08.870 --> 03:09.780
Wait, Anna-chan!

03:09.980 --> 03:12.120
Don't touch me in strange places!

03:12.130 --> 03:13.920
Stop it!

03:13.790 --> 03:23.790
The Sawatari Izumi Contest Series! A Daring Test of Courage! An Express Train to a Secret Hot Spring in the Northeast, a Mother-in-law Murdered in the Mist, a Madonna Teacher from an Elite Family Burning with Desire as They Watch a Housewife Battle For Control of Her Troubled Mansion!

03:24.680 --> 03:25.180
Well?

03:25.830 --> 03:26.980
What the hell is this?!

03:28.100 --> 03:29.840
Just what I looks like: a yukata.

03:28.100 --> 03:31.880
A yukata (浴衣) is a lightweight summer kimono made of cotton rather than the traditional silk.

03:29.950 --> 03:30.790
I know that!

03:30.930 --> 03:34.600
What I'm asking asking is when the hell did you put these together?!

03:34.840 --> 03:37.560
While you three were in the shower, obviously!

03:37.740 --> 03:39.500
The same with the maid uniforms.

03:39.620 --> 03:40.080
Huh?

03:40.290 --> 03:43.370
You mean you made those clothes after you met us?

03:43.550 --> 03:44.870
Of course!

03:45.180 --> 03:47.880
You can't get that perfect fit or precise hem length from clothing bought at a store,

03:48.080 --> 03:49.740
no matter what size you get!

03:50.360 --> 03:54.270
Why do you waste all your skill and enthusiams on this sort of thing?

03:54.480 --> 03:56.550
And besides, isn't the hem too short?

03:56.650 --> 03:58.500
Why did you come up with something like this?

03:58.700 --> 03:59.480
I'll tell you.

03:59.810 --> 04:01.570
It's because I heard a voice from the heavens!

04:01.920 --> 04:03.020
A voice from the heavens?

04:22.490 --> 04:24.000
And I saw this!

04:24.520 --> 04:26.120
First you examine the position of the crotch!

04:26.500 --> 04:30.420
Then, without straying a millimeter, you decide the hem of the yukata. All right?

04:30.800 --> 04:32.310
Thank you, God!

04:32.410 --> 04:34.140
Do you really think that kind of God exists?!

04:34.410 --> 04:35.380
What's with you?

04:35.430 --> 04:39.050
And here I went through all this trouble just so that all of you could enjoy the summer festival...

04:39.320 --> 04:40.650
The summer festival?

04:40.750 --> 04:41.390
I see.

04:41.430 --> 04:43.210
You can be surprisingly nice at times.

04:43.450 --> 04:45.210
Well, let's all get going!

04:45.320 --> 04:46.080
All right!

04:46.100 --> 04:47.800
It sounds like fun...

04:47.810 --> 04:50.720
The hip line in a kimono is so nice...

04:53.250 --> 04:55.660
You really haven't improved at all!

05:00.490 --> 05:01.930
Look at all the stores!

05:02.050 --> 05:03.120
Izumi-san, Izumi-san!

05:03.150 --> 05:04.770
Let's go into the haunted house!

05:05.050 --> 05:05.980
And once we're finally inside,

05:06.010 --> 05:09.030
we can slip into the dark, and I'll do this and that to you...

05:09.420 --> 05:10.120
Huh?

05:12.820 --> 05:13.990
Oh?

05:13.990 --> 05:15.190
A live show.

05:16.700 --> 05:17.530
Hey, Mitsuki-chan!

05:17.530 --> 05:19.550
Heeey!

05:22.840 --> 05:24.350
Come on up, Mitsuki-chan!

05:25.130 --> 05:26.110
Bye, Onee-chan!

05:26.230 --> 05:27.200
I'll see you afterwards!

05:28.500 --> 05:29.720
Here we go!

05:30.440 --> 05:31.680
All right!

05:32.030 --> 05:40.330
Watashi wa kawaii meido san na no aa

05:32.030 --> 05:40.330
Oh what a cute... maid I am...

05:40.650 --> 05:41.410
Die!

05:41.740 --> 05:42.210
Die!

05:42.350 --> 05:44.470
She just jumped right in... and it's heavy metal.

05:42.880 --> 05:43.580
Die!

05:43.980 --> 05:44.670
Die!

05:44.680 --> 05:46.620
And isn't there an awful lot of people in her Bodyguard Squad?

05:46.900 --> 05:49.310
I understand Mitsuki-chan less and less...

05:49.780 --> 05:50.680
Izumi-san!

05:49.780 --> 05:52.210
Goldfish Capture

05:50.780 --> 05:52.330
Let's go capture goldfish!

05:52.550 --> 05:54.480
All right, leave it to me!

05:56.590 --> 05:57.770
That's incredible!

05:58.670 --> 05:59.440
Wow, you're pretty good!

05:59.720 --> 06:00.410
Well, you know.

06:00.440 --> 06:03.540
I've been putting my life on the line at these festival games since I was a kid.

06:04.880 --> 06:06.860
My, my... I'm not very good at these things myself.

06:09.880 --> 06:10.820
Oops!

06:16.090 --> 06:17.940
You <i>had</i> to do it, didn't you?!

06:18.450 --> 06:20.890
Yoshitaka-kun, good job!

06:21.330 --> 06:24.170
Well, Izumi-san, let's do some target shooting next!

06:26.090 --> 06:28.110
I'm confident in my shooting skills too!

06:28.370 --> 06:30.100
Watch carefully!

06:32.020 --> 06:32.280
Ah, damn!

06:32.330 --> 06:33.780
This thing is pretty flimsy!

06:33.980 --> 06:35.630
In that case... how about this?!

06:35.990 --> 06:37.060
Izumi-san...

06:37.480 --> 06:38.100
What?

06:38.250 --> 06:40.410
Maybe you should bend forward a little more...

06:40.800 --> 06:41.390
Forward?

06:41.830 --> 06:42.350
Like this?

06:43.370 --> 06:44.470
A LITTLE MORE!

06:44.890 --> 06:45.270
Huh?

06:46.800 --> 06:47.900
So what the hell were <i>you</i> watching?!

06:48.350 --> 06:49.390
Anna-chan, you too!

06:50.260 --> 06:50.980
Ah, Izumi-san!

06:51.280 --> 06:52.780
I can't hold back any longer!

06:53.390 --> 06:54.890
Hey, h-hold on a minute!

06:54.990 --> 06:55.890
Sawatari Izumi!

06:57.420 --> 06:58.800
You do indeed have precise shooting skills.

06:59.130 --> 07:01.530
Those skills are the second-best in Japan!

07:01.770 --> 07:02.780
Second best?

07:02.980 --> 07:04.780
So who's the best in Japan?

07:09.110 --> 07:09.950
Interesting.

07:10.400 --> 07:13.780
In that case, knock over that gold tanuki in three shots!

07:13.950 --> 07:16.750
If you can't do it, your;re treating me to a candy apple, cotton candy, a snow-cone,

07:16.840 --> 07:18.000
fried tofu, and corn-on-the-cob, all right?

07:29.160 --> 07:30.100
Ah, I messed up. I messed up.

07:30.280 --> 07:31.180
One more time...

07:38.100 --> 07:40.090
Just as I though, you're doing it on purpose...

07:40.520 --> 07:42.650
Die! Just DIE!

07:47.410 --> 07:48.130
Pochi!

07:48.230 --> 07:50.470
Is it all right for him to be walking around in a place like this?

07:50.680 --> 07:53.540
It looks like everyone around him thinks it's a suit.

07:56.290 --> 07:56.740
Hey, hol-

07:57.520 --> 07:58.770
Izumi-saan!

08:01.260 --> 08:02.230
Mitsuki-chan!

08:02.230 --> 08:04.100
No sighting at Points A or B.

08:02.280 --> 08:03.630
Mitsuki-chan...

08:04.480 --> 08:05.990
Widen your search area!

08:05.390 --> 08:06.680
Mitsuki-chaaan!

08:06.710 --> 08:07.300
Yes, sir!

08:07.300 --> 08:08.610
Mitsuki-chan!

08:07.940 --> 08:08.610
Ow!

08:08.610 --> 08:09.890
Mitsuki-chan, where are you?

08:10.270 --> 08:11.780
Izumi-saaan!

08:10.270 --> 08:12.680
Mitsuki-chan!

08:12.290 --> 08:13.730
What's all the commotion about?

08:14.750 --> 08:16.750
Mitsuki-chan!

08:14.770 --> 08:18.390
Well, Mitsuki-chan's been missing for a while now!

08:18.490 --> 08:20.330
Thank you, everyone!

08:22.660 --> 08:24.870
What's more, she disappeared right in front of everyone's eyes!

08:25.240 --> 08:27.130
It wasn't part of the stage production?

08:27.360 --> 08:27.950
No.

08:27.360 --> 08:29.280
MITSUKI-CHAN!

08:29.880 --> 08:31.290
Mitsuki-chan!

08:31.290 --> 08:32.730
Where are you?

08:32.580 --> 08:33.710
Mitsuki-chan!

08:35.230 --> 08:35.940
What's this?

08:40.750 --> 08:42.290
Where are you taking us?

08:43.740 --> 08:44.330
Yoshita-

08:44.400 --> 08:45.030
Here we are.

08:47.210 --> 08:48.480
W-What is this?

08:48.700 --> 08:49.760
A pyramid?!

08:50.150 --> 08:51.420
It's my parents' grave.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.080
A grave?!

08:52.130 --> 08:53.760
It's more like a <i>kofun</i>!

08:52.130 --> 08:56.280
a 'kofun' (古墳) is an ancient mound-shaped tomb often associated with the ancient imperial family.

08:53.880 --> 08:56.280
Your parents really had no common sense in anything they did.

08:57.350 --> 08:58.010
This way.

09:01.660 --> 09:02.960
This is kind of ominous.

09:08.210 --> 09:09.300
We don't have a choice.

09:09.300 --> 09:10.870
Pochi, wait for us there, all right?

09:13.810 --> 09:15.060
My dad liked these kind of things.

09:15.300 --> 09:16.330
He was always showing off.

09:16.910 --> 09:21.400
So, like you, your dad was an annoying person who wanted to be the center of attention, huh?

09:21.310 --> 09:24.030
Nakabayashi Family

09:22.140 --> 09:22.840
You could say that.

09:24.390 --> 09:26.950
A Japanese-style grave inside of a pyramid?

09:27.150 --> 09:29.790
Don't tell me you came here to visit their grave!

09:29.870 --> 09:31.500
We have to hurry up and look for Mitsuki!

09:31.630 --> 09:32.660
Now just wait a minute.

09:32.830 --> 09:35.050
This might be a long shot, but...

09:37.220 --> 09:40.850
Thanks to your inheritance, I'm having the time of my life!

09:41.220 --> 09:44.450
It's all because you saved as much as you could but never used it for fun while you were alive!

09:44.580 --> 09:45.230
Are you jealous?

09:45.380 --> 09:46.500
You must be jealous!

09:46.610 --> 09:50.710
Be grateful. I'm going to spend all of it down to the last yen, before I die!

09:53.000 --> 09:53.780
What's that?

09:55.670 --> 09:59.020
What kind of grave visit... is that?!

10:00.670 --> 10:01.590
You shitty brat!

10:02.010 --> 10:03.980
To think you've finally come to a visit my grave...

10:04.190 --> 10:06.060
Did you come to be a nuisance?

10:06.500 --> 10:07.150
Pops!

10:07.680 --> 10:09.540
Just as I thought, you came back!

10:09.850 --> 10:10.990
Where's Mitsuki-chan?!

10:11.340 --> 10:13.240
I thought his father was dead.

10:13.660 --> 10:15.570
If he came back, then that means...

10:15.790 --> 10:16.760
A ghost?!

10:17.110 --> 10:20.530
Th-Then is it possible that Yoshitaka's father took Mitsuki!?

10:20.680 --> 10:23.090
Now, what are you talking about?

10:23.230 --> 10:24.290
Don't act like you don't know!

10:24.630 --> 10:25.980
This medal is proof!

10:27.000 --> 10:27.770
That's...

10:28.130 --> 10:32.230
When you died, I put this medal in your coffin so you would have it!

10:32.710 --> 10:35.080
Incidentally, I found it at an arcade!

10:35.320 --> 10:36.180
You bastard!

10:36.600 --> 10:38.480
And I left you all that money!

10:38.600 --> 10:40.030
How dare you...?

10:40.330 --> 10:43.110
It was a pain in the ass crossing the Sanzu River, you know!

10:43.240 --> 10:44.160
Like I care!

10:44.360 --> 10:46.270
What an ugly fight between father and son...

10:48.350 --> 10:49.150
Whatever.

10:49.610 --> 10:54.290
In return, I'm going to help myself to your cute maids.

10:54.480 --> 10:55.430
What a terrible father!

10:55.630 --> 10:58.400
Wait. Don't tell me that's why you took Mitsuki?!

11:02.080 --> 11:04.230
So you two are Yoshitaka's maids?!

11:04.490 --> 11:07.420
Such young, cute maids are wasted on him!

11:08.020 --> 11:08.750
Especially you!

11:08.970 --> 11:10.300
You're the kind I like the best.

11:10.390 --> 11:11.650
I'm taking you.

11:11.840 --> 11:12.300
Huh?

11:12.360 --> 11:13.090
What?

11:13.230 --> 11:14.580
You mean you're taking me with you?

11:15.140 --> 11:16.390
Don't be stupid!

11:16.850 --> 11:18.680
First off, how do you know about my maids?!

11:19.960 --> 11:21.960
I heard the rumors about you.

11:22.060 --> 11:23.950
The boy in the midst of puberty who inherited his parents' fortune, and...

11:23.810 --> 11:25.340
And so on...

11:27.470 --> 11:31.880
And I arranged everything tonight so I could have this girl!

11:32.130 --> 11:33.060
Farewell!

11:33.170 --> 11:33.530
Wai-

11:34.000 --> 11:34.530
Dumbass!

11:34.630 --> 11:36.170
Get to Nirvana by yourself!

11:36.320 --> 11:37.900
I won't hand Izumi-san over to you!

11:38.040 --> 11:40.170
Ah, no, wait. Don't cling to me!

11:40.320 --> 11:40.980
Ah, damn it!

11:41.120 --> 11:42.040
Let go!

11:42.120 --> 11:43.720
Do not look, Yoshitaka!

11:44.150 --> 11:45.980
Well, let's have a contest!

11:59.430 --> 12:01.510
The Sawatari Izumi Contest Series!

12:01.710 --> 12:02.870
A Daring Test of Courage!

12:03.050 --> 12:04.770
An Express Train to a Secret Hot Spring in the Northeast,

12:04.820 --> 12:05.560
A Mother-in-law Murdered in the Mist,

12:05.610 --> 12:07.020
A Madonna Teacher from an Elite Family

12:07.070 --> 12:09.020
Burning with Desire as They Watch a Housewife

12:09.070 --> 12:11.460
Battle for Control of Her Troubled Mansion!

12:11.620 --> 12:13.250
You really do need to give it a little oomph!

12:13.560 --> 12:14.530
M-Mitsuki!

12:14.700 --> 12:16.260
You mean you were here willingly?!

12:16.400 --> 12:19.210
Yeah, there was an interesting old man, so I just went to play with him!

12:21.100 --> 12:22.570
Don't tell me you two...

12:22.880 --> 12:24.990
What do you think of my Onee-chan?

12:25.280 --> 12:25.750
Yeah!

12:25.970 --> 12:27.430
She sure is to my liking!

12:27.570 --> 12:29.760
I-I got manipulated by Mitsuki again?!

12:29.910 --> 12:31.430
Now for the rules.

12:31.790 --> 12:36.380
If Master or Anna protect Onne-chan and escort her to the shrine unharmed, they win!

12:36.520 --> 12:40.350
Of course, his father and the others will try to get in their way while they do that.

12:40.600 --> 12:41.380
'The others'?

12:41.840 --> 12:43.760
These are his friends!

12:44.810 --> 12:47.220
So what do I get if <i>I</i> win?

12:47.410 --> 12:50.490
Naturally, the winner can do as he pleases with Onee-chan!

12:50.880 --> 12:52.030
Th-This isn't funny!

12:52.080 --> 12:53.190
Don't just decide things on your own!

12:53.960 --> 12:57.440
But at this rate, you'll be taken to the other world, Onee-chan!

12:57.700 --> 12:58.990
Even this is preferable to that, right?

12:59.150 --> 13:00.910
That's true, but...

13:01.070 --> 13:02.250
It'll be fine!

13:02.560 --> 13:05.490
Well, everyone, are you ready?

13:06.900 --> 13:07.780
She's really into this...

13:07.870 --> 13:09.430
Just as I thought, she's enjoying it.

13:09.640 --> 13:12.750
Now then, ready... GO!

13:16.600 --> 13:18.440
This place is really creepy...

13:21.470 --> 13:23.050
Izumi-san, I'm scared!

13:23.200 --> 13:24.370
Y-Yeah.

13:24.740 --> 13:25.350
But...

13:25.770 --> 13:28.220
There are even more suspicious presences behind me.

13:30.720 --> 13:31.430
I knew it!

13:31.670 --> 13:33.780
I just saw a suspicious shadow!

13:34.150 --> 13:38.740
It looked like a perverted lolicon uniform fetishist who loves peeping pictures and plays girl simulation games!

13:38.950 --> 13:40.540
That's just Yoshitaka!

13:40.680 --> 13:42.150
I'm scaaaared!

13:43.070 --> 13:43.660
Stop that!

13:43.720 --> 13:44.220
Anna-chan, no!

13:46.460 --> 13:49.440
Oh, no! The path at night is so dark that I tripped!

13:51.930 --> 13:53.400
Hey, what the hell are you doing?!

13:53.480 --> 13:54.210
Like I know!

13:54.660 --> 13:57.490
It's even more dangerous to be with you two than the ghosts!

13:58.190 --> 13:58.780
Wait, Izumi!

13:58.970 --> 14:00.050
It's dangerous being alone!

14:00.180 --> 14:00.970
Stay with me!

14:01.090 --> 14:01.640
That's right!

14:01.680 --> 14:03.130
Stay with me!

14:04.530 --> 14:06.110
Don't follow me!

14:05.060 --> 14:06.980
Izumi-saaaan!

14:06.510 --> 14:07.660
You're not getting away!

14:07.790 --> 14:08.890
Nooo!

14:12.510 --> 14:15.720
At last... This day has come at last!

14:16.730 --> 14:19.150
Even though I'm a ghost, I'm bad at scaring people.

14:19.580 --> 14:23.100
My friends tell me, "You're like a ghost that appears in manga," and the like!

14:23.800 --> 14:26.120
But... today will be...

14:26.120 --> 14:27.370
MOVE IT!

14:30.450 --> 14:31.180
Ah, I'm no good.

14:31.550 --> 14:35.930
I really am one of those ghosts from manga that can't scare anybody.

14:37.460 --> 14:38.380
Are you all right?

14:41.610 --> 14:42.240
Ah, this is...

14:42.470 --> 14:43.090
That's right.

14:43.310 --> 14:48.210
I'm one of those tragic heroine ghosts that falls helplessly in love with a human!

14:48.760 --> 14:50.430
Ah, this is bad!

14:50.800 --> 14:52.000
Your outfit's coming loose. Allow me...

14:52.240 --> 14:55.400
What... are... you... DOING?!

14:56.680 --> 14:58.480
I knew you were a man without honor,

14:58.640 --> 15:00.470
But I can't believe you'd feel up a ghost!

15:01.000 --> 15:01.850
Don't get in my way, Izumi!

15:02.210 --> 15:03.450
Infidelity is in a man's nature!

15:03.580 --> 15:04.170
Forgive me!

15:05.140 --> 15:07.930
WHEN DID I BECOME YOUR WIFE?!

15:08.300 --> 15:09.770
At any rate, let's hurry up and get going!

15:09.970 --> 15:12.060
Onee-chan, you've become a pretty intense straight man!

15:12.480 --> 15:14.800
I wish I could have met you while you were alive!

15:15.130 --> 15:17.810
She's just a disposable character. Let her be.

15:18.330 --> 15:19.430
"Disposable"?

15:24.830 --> 15:25.460
Stop!

15:30.140 --> 15:31.920
All right! Pretend you didn't see that!

15:32.310 --> 15:33.870
Hold it, you three!

15:36.020 --> 15:38.870
You have all fallen into my spell!

15:39.160 --> 15:41.640
You won't easily get away now!

15:41.760 --> 15:43.090
What do you mean by "spell"?

15:43.280 --> 15:45.110
Weren't you a ghost?

15:45.830 --> 15:49.730
Observe the power I've obtained while training in my world!

15:50.080 --> 15:51.210
What a tricky bastard!

15:51.550 --> 15:54.510
There only one way to divert his attention in a situation like this!

15:56.400 --> 15:58.250
Izumi-san's thighs!

15:58.570 --> 16:00.500
Hey, Anna-chan, stop it!

16:00.300 --> 16:01.680
They're mine!

16:00.940 --> 16:02.580
This is all you ever do, Yoshitaka!

16:03.220 --> 16:05.060
Onee-chan, they're still showing.

16:03.220 --> 16:04.340
Izumi-san!

16:05.550 --> 16:07.470
Anna-chan, let go!

16:07.830 --> 16:11.210
D-Don't... ignore me!

16:13.370 --> 16:14.120
It's hot!

16:14.560 --> 16:15.540
What's this?

16:17.070 --> 16:21.930
If I leave them alone, the flames will get stronger and burn you all to a crisp!

16:22.200 --> 16:23.190
What did you say?!

16:23.480 --> 16:24.390
Don't joke around!

16:24.650 --> 16:25.670
Yoshitaka,

16:26.190 --> 16:28.860
I've been so lonely since I died.

16:29.270 --> 16:33.780
It was unfortunate that death separated us, my precious only son.

16:33.980 --> 16:35.920
So what about it, you...

16:37.420 --> 16:39.470
Do you want to save those girls?

16:40.110 --> 16:41.890
Then I'll give you a choice!

16:47.100 --> 16:50.640
Jump off that cliff and come to this world.

16:50.920 --> 16:54.060
If you do, I'll let those girls go free.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.610
What are you talking about?!

16:58.760 --> 17:00.540
I've never seen a father like you!

17:00.790 --> 17:03.200
Well, he <i>is</i> Yoshitaka-kun's father!

17:03.720 --> 17:04.580
Seriously.

17:05.900 --> 17:07.190
Well, Yoshitaka?

17:16.120 --> 17:19.910
If I go to that world, you really won't touch Izumi and the others?

17:20.950 --> 17:22.120
I give you my word.

17:23.460 --> 17:24.230
Yoshitaka?

17:25.280 --> 17:25.940
Izumi.

17:26.720 --> 17:28.650
I'm giving all of my fortune to you.

17:29.250 --> 17:30.230
Live well.

17:30.310 --> 17:30.930
Wait!

17:35.880 --> 17:36.670
YOSHITAKA!

17:40.900 --> 17:43.000
And now, I've won the contest!

17:46.110 --> 17:48.740
You're going to come to this world!

17:48.940 --> 17:49.660
You monster!

17:49.670 --> 17:50.800
What about that promise earlier?!

17:51.020 --> 17:53.000
Promises are made to be broken!

17:53.300 --> 17:55.060
Who do you think I am?

17:55.340 --> 17:57.040
I'm Yoshitaka's father!

17:57.320 --> 17:58.130
He certainly is.

17:58.280 --> 17:59.210
Seriously.

18:01.020 --> 18:02.210
Now, farewell!

18:02.240 --> 18:03.360
Onee-san!

18:02.370 --> 18:03.360
Izumi-san!

18:04.190 --> 18:05.550
THAT'S ENOUGH ALREADY!

18:07.840 --> 18:09.220
W-Who are you?

18:09.380 --> 18:11.330
I'm sorry about that, Izumi-chan.

18:11.690 --> 18:13.940
My idiotic husband's been a pain in your neck.

18:14.150 --> 18:14.860
Husband?

18:15.210 --> 18:17.560
So you mean you're Yoshitaka's mother?!

18:17.760 --> 18:18.270
That's right.

18:18.730 --> 18:22.540
And I'm going to make sure this idiot doesn't come back again!

18:22.650 --> 18:23.360
You!

18:23.770 --> 18:28.580
I can't believe an old man like you would go after young girls while you have someone like me!

18:28.800 --> 18:30.910
Ah, no, I was just...

18:31.840 --> 18:33.200
More importantly, what about Yoshitaka?

18:33.380 --> 18:36.370
He sacrificed himself for me and jumped off of this cliff!

18:36.900 --> 18:38.160
That impudent kid?

18:38.380 --> 18:40.780
There's no way he would seriously do something like that.

18:41.460 --> 18:42.420
See for yourself.

18:46.660 --> 18:51.160
He probably planned on making my husband drop his guard so he could counterattack when he saw an opening.

18:51.430 --> 18:53.010
Then all that stuff earlier was...

18:53.150 --> 18:58.710
For starters, there's no way a true father would actually say, 'Come to this world,' is there?

19:00.480 --> 19:02.380
I'm sorry, girls.

19:02.550 --> 19:04.290
I put you through some frightening things.

19:04.770 --> 19:09.090
I was so worried about him being left all alone.

19:09.450 --> 19:13.200
I couldn't attain Nirvana until I saw for myself that he was doing well.

19:13.390 --> 19:15.400
But you're satisfied now, right?

19:15.760 --> 19:16.700
Don't dawdle around!

19:16.950 --> 19:18.280
Let's hurry up and go!

19:18.840 --> 19:19.640
Well, good-bye!

19:20.300 --> 19:24.470
It'll be tough, but I'm sure you can tame Yoshitaka.

19:25.220 --> 19:26.750
After all, you two...

19:27.380 --> 19:30.500
look just like we did when we were young.

19:36.610 --> 19:38.300
Well, take care!

19:38.820 --> 19:39.670
Farewell.

19:40.610 --> 19:44.080
So that's what Master and Onee-chan will look like in the future?

19:44.330 --> 19:45.470
Not a chance!

19:45.640 --> 19:48.790
Because I'm going to marry Izumi-san in Holland!

19:45.640 --> 19:48.790
The Dutch Parliament passed a bill giving full rights to homosexual married couples on September 12, 2000.

19:49.200 --> 19:52.330
Hey! Give me a hand!

19:53.000 --> 19:53.740
What happened to Pops?

19:54.050 --> 19:55.750
I thought I heard Mom's voice, too.

19:56.690 --> 19:58.020
They're gone now.

20:01.300 --> 20:02.520
Wh-What's wrong?

20:04.050 --> 20:06.460
This is surprisingly convenient.

20:07.050 --> 20:07.770
Izumi...

20:08.210 --> 20:10.740
If you go away, so does my debt.

20:11.180 --> 20:13.090
So do my hardships.

20:13.530 --> 20:14.720
I can have everything I want.

20:15.190 --> 20:15.850
Izumi...

20:16.570 --> 20:17.700
You're joking, right?

20:17.860 --> 20:22.210
Even if it's one minute, one <i>second</i>... I want to be rid of you as soon as possible.

20:43.860 --> 20:44.640
Izumi?

20:45.280 --> 20:46.680
I-I'll say this now!

20:46.930 --> 20:49.270
Everything I said before was true!

20:49.650 --> 20:53.620
It's just that... not having a place to live tomorrow would really be a pain.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.210
Izumi...

20:58.350 --> 21:00.060
Here. You're almost there.

21:01.060 --> 21:01.690
Y-Yeah!

21:02.350 --> 21:03.560
Huh?

21:09.030 --> 21:10.320
You son of a...

21:10.800 --> 21:12.330
YOU REALLY SHOULD DIE!

21:21.560 --> 21:22.490
Dammit...

21:22.780 --> 21:24.170
That damn Izumi...

21:27.960 --> 21:30.020
He took a lot today too!

21:30.180 --> 21:32.730
Master is working hard!

21:32.860 --> 21:34.170
I wonder how he took them.

21:34.570 --> 21:36.960
Onee-chan's so popular!

21:37.690 --> 21:39.920
And she's ranked #1 by a huge margin!

21:38.180 --> 21:39.890
Time Before That: 1st Place

21:38.180 --> 21:39.890
Previous: 1st Place

21:38.180 --> 21:39.890
Ranking Change

21:40.400 --> 21:41.470
Mitsuki!

21:41.580 --> 21:42.980
Take a bath and hurry to bed.

21:43.230 --> 21:44.060
All right!

21:44.060 --> 21:45.660
I'll give Pochi a bath today too.

21:45.760 --> 21:47.080
Onee-chan, where's Pochi?

21:47.500 --> 21:47.940
Huh?

21:48.180 --> 21:49.000
Pochi?

21:51.560 --> 21:52.560
Mitsuki-chan!

21:58.290 --> 21:59.680
What's wrong, Onee-chan?

21:58.290 --> 22:13.250
Izumi's debt from today

22:00.190 --> 22:02.180
Izumi-san's thighs...

22:02.260 --> 22:13.250
How much Izumi has left before she pays off her debt

22:02.380 --> 22:04.170
Damn you, Izumi!

22:27.550 --> 22:30.980
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.550 --> 22:30.980
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.550 --> 22:30.980
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:30.990 --> 22:34.730
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:30.990 --> 22:34.730
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:30.990 --> 22:34.730
and they're not weak either.

22:34.760 --> 22:39.700
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:34.760 --> 22:39.700
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:34.760 --> 22:39.700
Girls are pretty stable.

22:41.780 --> 22:44.990
意地っ張り空回りを

22:41.780 --> 22:44.990
ijippari karamawari wo

22:41.780 --> 22:44.990
Because they're stubborn,

22:45.070 --> 22:48.850
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:45.070 --> 22:48.850
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:45.070 --> 22:48.850
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:48.860 --> 22:53.580
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:48.860 --> 22:53.580
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:48.860 --> 22:53.580
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.280 --> 22:55.910
どうかナ?

22:54.280 --> 22:55.910
dou ka na?

22:54.280 --> 22:55.910
I wonder...

22:56.190 --> 23:02.310
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.190 --> 23:02.310
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.190 --> 23:02.310
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.440 --> 23:09.930
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.440 --> 23:09.930
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.440 --> 23:09.930
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:10.030 --> 23:16.810
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:10.030 --> 23:16.810
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:10.030 --> 23:16.810
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:17.070 --> 23:23.790
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:17.070 --> 23:23.790
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:17.070 --> 23:23.790
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:24.110 --> 23:31.120
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:24.110 --> 23:31.120
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:24.110 --> 23:31.120
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.180 --> 23:38.230
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.180 --> 23:38.230
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.180 --> 23:38.230
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:46.000 --> 23:47.450
Anna-chan, what's wrong?

23:47.570 --> 23:50.400
'Yuri' (百合) refers to anime and manga that focuses on relationships between two women.

23:47.570 --> 23:50.400
The publishing of the yuri magazine I subscribed to has been suspended!

23:50.580 --> 23:51.080
Ah, I see.

23:51.110 --> 23:52.360
That has nothing to with me, but-

23:52.430 --> 23:53.580
It <i>does</i> have something to with you!

23:53.830 --> 23:58.830
I wrote a manga called "She is my Onee-sama" about the love-love story of Izumi-san and me,

23:58.860 --> 24:00.650
and I was thinking of submitting it!

24:00.770 --> 24:01.280
Hold it!

24:01.310 --> 24:02.210
Show me that manga!

24:02.300 --> 24:02.820
Here!

24:02.900 --> 24:03.980
It's my pride and joy!

24:04.050 --> 24:04.830
Let's see...

24:05.070 --> 24:07.070
"Oh, my. The garter belt came off."

24:07.280 --> 24:09.400
"The alligator god with the glasses is watching."

24:08.260 --> 24:13.250
He is Izumi's❤❤❤!?

24:09.670 --> 24:12.220
"Ah, you are my longed-for Izumi-oneesama"?!
